# Local-only folders (not pushed to repo).
# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING (S17, found by CI): an unanchored `Prompts/` matches a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, and on Windows the match is case-insensitive — so
# it also swallowed packages/core/src/medcore/prompts/. The entire safety policy (refusal
# rules, injection defence, citation requirement) was therefore never in version control,
# and a fresh clone could not start: `prompt system_v1 not found; available: []`.
# Silent, because the files existed locally and every local run passed.
/demo/
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
